From 06514b3c09483dfaf752328b8af108b5d999226a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oxide 1-6 <yes.par781@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 11:33:54 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] plugin: register UnNova's process service

Adds the two sources that shell/plugin/src/ provides to the services
module. shell/build.sh copies them into the tree before this patch is
applied, like the AI types.

  Caelestia.Services  Processes   processes visible to this user, read
                                  from /proc once a second while a
                                  ServiceRef holds it; signals only the
                                  exact process a PID and start time name
---
 plugin/src/Caelestia/Services/CMakeLists.txt | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/plugin/src/Caelestia/Services/CMakeLists.txt b/plugin/src/Caelestia/Services/CMakeLists.txt
index cffd62e8..0d655b4f 100644
--- a/plugin/src/Caelestia/Services/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/plugin/src/Caelestia/Services/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -19,6 +19,8 @@ qml_module(caelestia-services
         lyrics.cpp
         sessionmanager.cpp
         networkusage.cpp
+        procfs.cpp
+        processes.cpp
         hyprdevices.cpp
         hyprextras.cpp
     LIBRARIES
